(corpus-ch4-049)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when gamgd<0 goto 4
    *when tseg>1000 goto 10
  *segment 4 synthetic target
    *when time>1 stop
  *segment 10 synthetic target
    *when time>1 stop
*end
